{"text": "Bhullar Chartered Professional Accountants\nFile: EST-25-077 -- FAIRWEATHER ESTATE          notes by G. Bhullar, 14-Apr-2026\n\nDeceased:  Margaret-Anne Fairweather (\"Peggy\"), SIN 540 570 496\n           b. 17 Nov 1928, d. 2 Aug 2025 (aged 96), widow, resident of\n           Perth, Ontario all year.\nExecutor:  her son Alasdair Fairweather, 61 Drummond St. E., Perth ON K7H 1G3\n           tel 613-555-0138, alasdair.fairweather@mail.example\nLawyer:    Yvette Laframboise, Laframboise Wills & Estates Professional Corporation\n           (probate granted 9 Jan 2026, court file CV-25-00412-ES)\nEstate trust account no. (CRA): T 4418 7702\n\nFINAL T1 (Jan 1 - Aug 2, 2025) -- due April 30, 2026, balance owing likely\n - OAS/CPP/pension to date of death: $31,406\n - RRIF at Rideau Lakes Credit Union, plan no. RLF-0028841: FMV at death\n   $188,930.12, no qualifying survivor, so fully included in income. Ouch.\n - Deemed disposition, subsection 70(5): non-registered portfolio, ACB\n   $96,000 vs FMV $141,750 -> gain $45,750.\n - House, 9 Mill Lane, Perth: principal residence, exempt. Sold 11 Dec 2025\n   for $612,000 -- gain since death (12k) belongs on the T3, not here.\n - Medical: $22,480 to the retirement home, incl. the memory care wing\n   surcharge from March. Attendant care certificate on file (Alzheimer's).\n - Donations by will: $20,000 to Lanark Highlands Hospice Society; $5,000 to\n   the Kirk session of her church. Claim on final T1 or T3 -- model both.\n\nT3 FOR THE ESTATE (GRE, first year-end 1 Aug 2026)\n - TFSA at RLCU, no. TF-7741093, $74,215 at death; growth after death\n   $1,102 is taxable to the estate.\n - CPP death benefit $2,500.\n - 2014 Subaru Forester, plate CKLM 418, VIN JF2SJCDC5EH447120, sold to\n   a neighbour for $6,000. Personal-use property, loss denied.\n - The 1958 cedar-strip launch \"Heather Belle\" kept at Otty Lake -- appraised\n   $18,500, going in specie to Alasdair. Listed personal property? Check.\n\nBENEFICIARIES\n - Alasdair, 50%. SIN 364-364-513.\n - Catriona Fairweather-Menzies (daughter), 50%. Lives in Inverness,\n   non-resident of Canada since 1998 -> Part XIII withholding 25% on\n   income distributions, NR4 slip. UK NI no. for her adviser: JG 10 37 59 A.\n   Her share to be wired to IBAN GB90 HBUK 1941 5563 0721 37 once clearance arrives.\n\nTO DO\n - TX19 clearance certificate request after assessments. Hold back $40,000.\n - Ask Mme Laframboise for the passed accounts.\n - Fee estimate to Mr. Fairweather: $4,200 plus HST. He wants to pay by\n   e-transfer to payments@bhullarcpa.example.\n - Peggy's 2024 return was never filed (in hospital Feb-Apr 2025 with a\n   broken hip). File late with the final.", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "403 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Margaret-Anne Fairweather", "Alasdair Fairweather", "Yvette Laframboise", "Catriona Fairweather-Menzies", "Mme Laframboise", "Peggy"], "companies": ["Bhullar Chartered Professional Accountants", "Rideau Lakes Credit Union", "Lanark Highlands Hospice Society", "Kirk session of her church", "IBAN", "bhullarcpa"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Perth", "Ontario", "ON", "Rideau Lakes Credit Union", "Lanark Highlands Hospice Society", "Kirk session of her church", "Otty Lake", "Inverness", ""], "health": ["broken hip", "hospital"], "sensitive": ["Margaret-Anne Fairweather ("], "names": ["Margaret-Anne", "Peggy", "Alasdair", "Mme Laframboise", "Mr. Fairweather"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.4000000022351742, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 